     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Indirect speech",
     "texto": [
      "After **a declarat că**, the present can be kept if the situation is still valid. Romanian does not mechanically change all the tenses as is often done in English."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Journalistic conditional",
     "texto": [
      "**Ar fi fost amânată** can express \"would have been postponed\", depending on the source; in a news story it can indicate that the outlet does not confirm the fact on its own."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
